OL,3,GNEWSATwo recycling sites to temporarily
OL,4,Aclose for works
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo recycling and household waste sites
OL,7,Fin Leicestershire will close
OL,8,Ftemporarily later this month for
OL,9,Fimprovement works.
OL,11,FLeicestershire County Council said its
OL,12,FKibworth site would close from 24
OL,13,FNovember for up to eight weeks as waste
OL,14,Fbays are made more robust.
OL,16,FThe authority's Melton site will be
OL,17,Fshut between 30 November and 4 December
OL,18,Fas the lower yard is resurfaced.
OL,20,FThe Market Harborough site will be open
OL,21,Fseven days a week from 26 November
OL,22,Funtil Kibworth reopens.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
